# CocoaPods fallback artifacts. The example builds through Swift Package
# Manager, the Flutter stable default. A machine that has opted out of SPM
# globally falls back to CocoaPods, and the tool writes these two files on
# its way through. Nothing in the repository reads them.
Podfile
Podfile.lock

